Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"hari",
    "password":"password@123",
    "email":"hari@gmail.com",
    "phone":"7034567856"
}

#api call for fetching token
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"delsa",
    "password":"password@123"
}

#api call for fetching current user
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/profile/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token 34b80672ff01aa85d42e266f6faac2841cca0dc3

#api call for fetching lead
###
